Package: gpqyouden
Title: Generalized Pivotal Quantity Inference for the Youden Index
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Juan José", "Olmedilla Arregui",
    email = "juanjo@olmedilla.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Monte Carlo simulation study of generalized pivotal quantity
    (GPQ) based confidence intervals for the Youden index and its optimal
    cut-point, following Lai, Tian and Schisterman (2012)
    <doi:10.1016/j.csda.2010.11.023>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jolmedilla/gpqyouden
BugReports: https://github.com/jolmedilla/gpqyouden/issues
